 it is. ### What is part 1 of schedule 1? Greens Senator [Sarah Hanson-Young](https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/people/senate/sa/sarah_hanson-young) [explains](http://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?id=2015-03-19.41.1) that part 1 of schedule 1 includes: > *amendments being made to the issue of burden of proof and new claims.* > *This is one of the issues that was raised consistently throughout the Senate committee process—particularly, a number of legal experts are concerned about changing the expectations and shifting the burden of proof onto asylum seekers* Read more of Senator Hanson-Young's [explanation](http://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?gid=2015-03-19.53.1).","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-3729","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2015-03-19/6"}
